# migrations/
# This directory will contain Alembic database migration scripts.
# Alembic tracks schema changes as versioned migration files,
# allowing the database schema to evolve safely over time.
# Setup steps (to be done during implementation):
#   1. alembic init migrations
#   2. Configure alembic.ini with DATABASE_URL
#   3. Generate migrations: alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"
#   4. Apply migrations: alembic upgrade head
#   5. Rollback: alembic downgrade -1
